## Props Interface

```tsx
interface EtBuySellButtonProps {
  // Required
  type: 'buy' | 'sell'; // Determines letter (B/S) and color scheme
  price: number; // Formatted with 2 decimals automatically

  // State
  disabled?: boolean; // default: false
  oneClickTrading?: boolean; // default: false

  // Appearance
  size?: 'tiny' | 'small' | 'medium' | 'large'; // default: 'medium'
  positiveIndication?: boolean; // default: false - green filled
  negativeIndication?: boolean; // default: false - red filled

  // Interaction
  haptics?: boolean; // default: true
  onPress?: (event: GestureResponderEvent) => void;
  style?: StyleProp<ViewStyle>;

  // Accessibility
  testID?: string;
  accessibilityLabel?: string; // Auto-generated if not provided
}
```

## Visual States

| State                     | Background        | Letter/Divider/Price Colors        | Border          |
| ------------------------- | ----------------- | ---------------------------------- | --------------- |
| Default                   | bgNeutralPrimary  | Letter: type color, Price: neutral | dividerTertiary |
| Pressed                   | bgNeutralPrimary  | Same as default                    | type color      |
| One-click trading         | bgActionInfo      | All: inverted neutral              | transparent     |
| One-click trading pressed | bgActionInfoHover | All: inverted neutral              | transparent     |
| Positive indication       | bgActionBrand     | All: inverted neutral              | transparent     |
| Negative indication       | bgActionBrandVar  | All: inverted neutral              | transparent     |
| Disabled                  | bgActionDisabled  | All: disabled text                 | transparent     |

**State Priority:** `disabled` > `positiveIndication` > `negativeIndication` > `oneClickTrading` > `default`

## Size Configuration

Height is determined by padding + content (not hardcoded).

| Size   | paddingVertical | paddingHorizontal | gap       |
| ------ | --------------- | ----------------- | --------- |
| tiny   | X1 (4px)        | X3 (12px)         | X2 (8px)  |
| small  | X1 (4px)        | X3 (12px)         | X2 (8px)  |
| medium | X2 (8px)        | X3 (12px)         | X2 (8px)  |
| large  | X2 (8px)        | X4 (16px)         | X3 (12px) |

**Border radius:** 50px for all sizes (pill shape)
**Divider:** 1px width × X3 (12px) height

